{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06987","headline":"夜坐看搊筝 · 王諲","name":"夜坐看搊筝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"调筝夜坐灯光里，却挂罗帷露纤指。\n朱弦一一声不同，玉柱连连影相似。\n不知何处学新声？曲曲弹来未覩名。\n应是石家金谷里，流传未满洛阳城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王諲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}